Vivian Casterwill lived with her grandmother, [[Nimue Casterwill]], in the Casterwill Cave. The two greeted [[Sophie Casterwill]] and [[LeBlanche]] into the magical Casterwill Cave. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}}

Vivian accompanied her grandmother to the [[Fortress of Iron Will]] to reunite with the rest of the scattered members of the [[Casterwill family]]. In the ensuing fight against the [[Blood Spiral]], Vivian lost her grandmother, who sacrificed herself to protect the Casterwill family. As the next in line of the House of Weapons Makers, Vivian became the next [[:Category:Ladies of the Lake|Lady of the Lake]]. Vivian was subsequently given the [[Ring]] of [[Mythras]] by [[Sophie Casterwill]] to hearten the young girl. {{source|The Spiral War}}

As a part of the Casterwill-Foundation alliance that fought against the [[Blood Spiral]] at the [[Spiral Mark]], she used Mythras in battle. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}}

